{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit"]]},"metadata":{"title":"WebAuthn","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"WebAuthn"}],"externalID":"s:7YubiKit8WebAuthnO","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"WebAuthn"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"enum","modules":[{"name":"YubiKit"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"WebAuthn Client","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Client"],"anchor":"WebAuthn-Client"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/yubikit\/webauthn"]}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"WebAuthn"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Contains the high-level passkey "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Client","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and the request, response, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"data-model types defined by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/www.w3.org\/TR\/webauthn-3\/","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specification."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A passkey client and the W3C Web Authentication data model, mediated by a YubiKey."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"code":"WebAuthn","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" namespace provides a high-level passkey client ("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Client","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":") that runs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/www.w3.org\/TR\/webauthn-3\/","type":"reference","isActive":true,"overridingTitle":"Web Authentication Level 3","overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Web Authentication Level 3"}]},{"type":"text","text":" ceremonies against a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"YubiKey, plus the request and response types defined by the WebAuthn specification."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A WebAuthn ceremony involves three parties: the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"authenticator"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" (a YubiKey), the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"client"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" (your app, via "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Client","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"), and the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"relying party"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" (your server, which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"verifies what the authenticator returns). The client is the communication path between"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"authenticator and relying party — and it verifies the relying party’s identity against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the origin it’s bound to, so it can refuse to sign for a fraudulent site."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"There are two ceremonies. "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Registration"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Client\/makeCredential(_:authorization:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":") creates a new credential and supplies its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"public key to the relying party for account association. "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Authentication"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Client\/getAssertion(_:authorization:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":") proves to the relying party that the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"YubiKey is the one registered for the user. Both ceremonies follow the same mechanical"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shape: the relying party supplies a challenge, the authenticator signs it together"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with the relying-party identifier, and the signature goes back to the relying party"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for verification."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The pieces fit together as: a connection carries CTAP2 traffic, a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Session","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sits on top, and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Client","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" runs ceremonies on that session. Connections come in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"three flavours that all work for WebAuthn: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"YubiKit\/HIDFIDOConnection"},{"type":"text","text":" on macOS,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/NFCSmartCardConnection","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for tap-to-auth on iOS, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/USBSmartCardConnection","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" on either platform. Pick the one that matches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"your platform and form factor."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/ macOS — USB HID FIDO","let connection = try await HIDFIDOConnection()","\/\/ iOS — tap-to-auth over NFC:","\/\/ let connection = try await NFCSmartCardConnection()","","let session = try await CTAP2.Session.makeSession(connection: connection)","let client = WebAuthn.Client(","    session: session,","    origin: try .init(\"https:\/\/example.com\"),","    isPublicSuffix: { publicSuffixList.contains($0) }",")","","\/\/ Register a new passkey","let registration = try await client.makeCredential(","    .init(","        challenge: challenge,","        rp: .init(id: \"example.com\", name: \"Example\"),","        user: .init(id: userId, name: \"alice@example.com\")","    ),","    authorization: .pin(\"1234\")",").value","","\/\/ Authenticate","let assertions = try await client.getAssertion(","    .init(challenge: challenge, rpId: \"example.com\"),","    authorization: .pin(\"1234\")",").value"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Most apps start with "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Client","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". For lower-level CTAP2 access — raw "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"makeCredential"},{"type":"text","text":" \/"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"getAssertion"},{"type":"text","text":", credential management, bio enrollment — use "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Session","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" directly."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Client","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Client","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Authorization","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Origin","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/ClientError","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/ClientData","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/PublicSuffixChecker"],"anchor":"Client"},{"title":"Registration (makeCredential)","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Registration","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/PublicKeyCredentialCreationOptions"],"anchor":"Registration-makeCredential"},{"title":"Authentication (getAssertion)","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Authentication","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/PublicKeyCredentialRequestOptions"],"anchor":"Authentication-getAssertion"},{"title":"Status Reporting","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/StatusStream","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Status"],"anchor":"Status-Reporting"},{"title":"Relying Party and User Entities","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/RelyingParty","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/User","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/CredentialDescriptor","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Transport"],"anchor":"Relying-Party-and-User-Entities"},{"title":"Ceremony Preferences","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/ResidentKeyPreference","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\